  "methodology": "Synthetic deterministic directed graphs; 30 seeds by default per scenario. Each strategy executes in a separate child process for isolated peak RSS. Timing uses no tracing/profiler and separates initial build, updates and queries. BFS is exact oracle; bitset_bfs is conventional frontier search using integer adjacency masks; incremental_closure_dual maintains rows plus a transpose; aether_rows_only tests removal of the duplicate transpose; adaptive applies a cost model calibrated on phase-2 pilot medians to choose between bitset_bfs and aether_rows_only. Timings exclude process launch, data generation, serialization and output. No direct energy or FLOP measurement.",
